{
    "title": "Ride Freebee",
    "description": "Skip the stress of traffic and parking. Freebee\u2019s on-demand transportation service is safe, reliable and 100% free!\r\n\r\nFreebee\u2019s unique platform is transforming the way people experience their communities by inspiring local mobility and seamlessly connecting them with their destination by way of our fully electric vehicles.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s how to get started:\r\n\r\n1. Discover: Download the Ride Freebee app to browse our local recommendations and exclusive deals.\r\n2. Explore: Request a ride and wait for your friendly driver to arrive.\r\n3. Connect: Enjoy the ride and share your experience in The Hive. Redeem your Freebee deal once you reach your destination.\r\n\r\n\r\n#RideResponsibly\r\n\r\nFreebee is connecting people with the world around them, while aiding the economic development of local communities and advocating for a greener, safer earth. We do this by ensuring that our service is always free, convenient and most importantly, great for the environment.\r\n\r\nFree: Transportation can be expensive. By riding with Freebee, you can reallocate money saved on transportation to spend on local dining, shopping and entertainment.\r\n\r\nConvenient: Public transportation can be a hassle. Parking can be tricky to find and lugging heavy bags of groceries is sometimes too much to handle. With Freebee, you can enjoy the excitement of your local community, without the inconvenience of traditional transportation.\r\n\r\nElectric: Freebee vehicles are 100% electric, making them the most environmentally responsible transportation choice for you and your community.\r\n\r\nLove the app? Let us know by leaving a review!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Skip the stress of traffic and parking. Freebee\u2019s on-demand transportation service is safe, reliable and 100% free!<br><br>Freebee\u2019s unique platform is transforming the way people experience their communities by inspiring local mobility and seamlessly connecting them with their destination by way of our fully electric vehicles.<br><br>Here\u2019s how to get started:<br><br>1. Discover: Download the Ride Freebee app to browse our local recommendations and exclusive deals.<br>2. Explore: Request a ride and wait for your friendly driver to arrive.<br>3. Connect: Enjoy the ride and share your experience in The Hive. Redeem your Freebee deal once you reach your destination.<br><br><br>#RideResponsibly<br><br>Freebee is connecting people with the world around them, while aiding the economic development of local communities and advocating for a greener, safer earth. We do this by ensuring that our service is always free, convenient and most importantly, great for the environment.<br><br>Free: Transportation can be expensive. By riding with Freebee, you can reallocate money saved on transportation to spend on local dining, shopping and entertainment.<br><br>Convenient: Public transportation can be a hassle. Parking can be tricky to find and lugging heavy bags of groceries is sometimes too much to handle. With Freebee, you can enjoy the excitement of your local community, without the inconvenience of traditional transportation.<br><br>Electric: Freebee vehicles are 100% electric, making them the most environmentally responsible transportation choice for you and your community.<br><br>Love the app? Let us know by leaving a review!",
